Package: lenovo-thinkpad-t430-support
Architecture: all
Depends: convertible-power (>= 1.0.3), udev, network-manager, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: thermald, smartmontools, firmware-iwlwifi
Description: Lenovo ThinkPad T430 demo-laptop support for Debian
 Settings for the Lenovo ThinkPad T430 on a stock Debian GNOME desktop: it
 pulls in convertible-power (maximum performance on AC, maximum battery life
 on battery, no inactivity suspend at the login screen on AC) and adds this
 laptop's settings: lid ignored and no inactivity suspend on AC, screen off
 after 5 minutes, Wi-Fi power saving off, 75/80 charge thresholds.
 .
 The settings are applied only when the DMI product version is "ThinkPad T430".
